Bayin builds on CHIMERA, a physical-modelling voice synthesizer by Jameson Hodge
(https://github.com/jamesondh/chimera-vocal-synth, MIT License). Its airway simulation (tubes,
ports, radiation, the lip valve and whistle sources, and its deterministic math) and its human
voice model (anatomy, articulators, vocal folds, calibrated vowels) are used as a dependency,
unchanged, pinned in Cargo.toml. Bayin's instruments, player, space and steepening
stages, tools and data format are its own.
